d son lucaries now  Lord Corliss valerion also had half a  dozen nephews however the eldest of them  surveymon valerion did fight over his  inheritance because he thought driftmark  should go to him on the grounds that  raniera's Sons were bastards sired by  Sir Harwin after hearing about this  rhaenyra was not slow in answering this  accusation  she had Damon Targaryen see surveymon  and have his head removed then she fed  his dead body to her Dragon Cyrax  slicing off his head wasn't enough she  even wanted his dead body given to her  dragon as a little snack even this did  not end the matter however sir vamon's  younger brothers fled the King's Landing  with his wife and sons there to cry for  justice and set their own rights before  the king viserys had grown extremely fat  and read of face and scarce had the  strength to mount the steps to the Iron  Throne instead his grace heard them out  in a Stony silence then ordered every  one of their tongues to be removed you  were warned he declared as they were  being dragged away I will hear no more  of these lies so as you can see it was  written somewhat differently in the  novel The Sea Snake wasn't injured in  battle there wasn't this big dramatic  scene in the Great Hall of the red keep  either and we did not get that amazing  moment with visares now that is one  major addition I did love why watching  viserys enter the Great Hall in seeing  Damon help him onto the throne before he  stood up for his daughter was an amazing  way to do the scene however there is one  thing I wish they did add now maybe it  does sound a little dark but I wish we  did see renero feed his dead body to her  Dragon rather than only seeing rainey's  look over as the maesters worked on him  with that being said I do think the show  enhanced what George R Martin had  written in Fire and Blood he only had a  few lines that described what happened  whereas the show had this amazing moment  that involved nearly every main  character something