n Dany is given  the dragon eggs we heard illyrio say  they were from the shadowlands Beyond  shy but how did they actually get there  well in Fire and Blood we hear of  someone named Elisa farman who was said  to be in love with Reina Targaryen now  during the year of 54 AC Elisa  discreetly stole three dragon eggs from  dragonstone's hatcheries before sailing  off to essos where she would later sell  the eggs for a ship those three dragon  eggs were from the dragon dream fire who  we have already met in House of the  Dragon we saw dream fire during a scene  when aemon Targaryen went looking for a  dragon to mount of his own now if you  did notice in that scene dream fire did  look exactly like Danny's dragons and  that does make a lot of sense because  according to George R Martin's novel  Fire and Blood dream fire is the mother  of drogon rhaegal and viserion so if we  are to believe what is written in Fire  and Blood then dany's dragon eggs were  stolen from Dragonstone over 75 years  before the events in House of the Dragon  when we see Damon find those three  dragon eggs on Dragonstone dany's a egg  should have already been over ernestos  for many decades now that story was  written in Fire and Blood but that  doesn't mean House of the dragon's  writers won't do something different the  three dragon eggs found by Damon very  well could end up being the same eggs  Danny gets in season one of Game of  Thrones you never know the writers of  House of the Dragon might decide they  want to have dany's dragon eggs be from  Cyrax instead of dreamfire as you all  know that would give dany's dragons an  even greater connection to this show  either way we have already met the  mother of drogon rhaegal and viserion  whether it's dream fire or Cyrax I  happen to believe what's written in Fire  and Blood I think the mother of Danny's  dragon eggs is dreamfire considering how  much he actually looks just like drogon  rhaegar and viserion therefore I think  dany's dragon eggs